+            ),
+            format!("[E-DOCS-STALE] AGENTS.md:5: `game-testbed shoot`: no command `shoot` {usage}"),
+            "[E-DOCS-STALE] AGENTS.md:5: `replay dumpx r.rec`: no command `replay dumpx` (the \
